--------------------------------------
 Khrill Helm Control HELMET FOV addin
        Package instructions
--------------------------------------

1. Find a name for your package ^^ (<yourPachageName>)

2. Create a folder named <yourPachageName> in KhrillHelmControlFOVaddin\Fov directory

3. Copy all your textures in directory KhrillHelmControlFOVaddin\Fov\<yourPachageName>

4. Create an instance of file example.lua named <yourPachageName> in KhrillHelmControlFOVaddin\Fov directory

5. Edit this file and change :
5.1.	change line 10 : local PACKAGE_NAME = "<yourPachageName>"
5.2.	list all your texture's files (line 38) into itemStyle category like this :
			addinList[<ITEMSTYLE1>] = {
				"file1.dds",
				"file2.dds",
			}
			addinList[<ITEMSTYLE2>] = {
				"file3.dds",
			}


6. Create an instance of file KhrillHelmControlFOVpackexample.txt named KhrillHelmControlFOVpack<yourPachageName>.txt in KhrillHelmControlFOVaddin directory

7. Edit this file and change
7.1.	edit header strings (title, author, description, version)
7.2.	must have this line (8) :
			../KhrillHelmControlFOVaddin/Fov/<yourPachageName>.lua
			
8. Make a zip file with this structure :
	KhrillHelmControlFOVpack<yourPachageName>/KhrillHelmControlFOVpack<yourPachageName>.txt
	KhrillHelmControlFOVpack<yourPachageName>/Fov/<yourPachageName>.lua
	KhrillHelmControlFOVpack<yourPachageName>/Fov/<yourPachageName>/(all your dds texture files)

9. Post this package on ESOUI ;)